├─ 0-day: No patch available initially
├─ Attackers weaponized immediately
├─ Massive botnets created
├─ Data centers compromised
├─ Supply chain attacks

Organizations affected:
├─ Cloud providers (AWS, Azure, Google)
├─ Banks and financial institutions
├─ Fortune 500 companies
├─ Government agencies
├─ Healthcare providers
├─ Everyone using Java

Fix:
- Upgrade Log4j to 2.17.0+
- Or disable JNDI: -Dlog4j2.formatMsgNoLookups=true
- Took weeks for many organizations

Lesson: Component vulnerabilities can be catastrophic
